    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-11: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.30";
    dc:description "Public enumerations permit meaningful searches and counterexamples in chosen families. No feasible analysis can confirm the universal negative or infer computational equivalence merely from failure to detect structure.";
